Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(issues): pull requests in the approval panel
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

While an issue waits for the viewer's approval, the panel lists its pull requests
— the PRs linked to the issue, then GitHub PR links in its description and
comments, newest first, up to three — each with "Approve on GitHub" (opens the
PR's review page) and a note to approve the PR there, then Approve here.
Reference: Jira's development panel on approvals.

Patch-Id: approval-pr
